{"products": [{"id": 5234047320197, "title": "ASTRO DB BATTEN SERIES", "handle": "ol-40-watt-office-double-batten", "body_html": "<style>\np, li{\nfont-size: 13px;\n}\nspan{\nfont-size: 20px;\nfont-weight: 500px;\n}>\n</style>\n<p><span><b> Description</b></span></p>\n<h2 data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"234\">LED Linear Batten Light \u2013 4FT &amp; 2FT</h2>\n<p data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"560\">Upgrade your lighting with this sleek <strong data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"301\">LED Linear Batten Light</strong>, designed for modern spaces that demand efficiency, durability, and uniform illumination. Featuring a slim, minimalist profile with a high-quality frosted diffuser, this light delivers bright, glare-free output while blending seamlessly into any environment.Perfect for <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"651\">homes, offices, retail spaces, corridors, workshops, and commercial areas</strong>, the batten light provides consistent performance with low power consumption and long-lasting reliability.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"777\">Key Features:</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"1263\">\n<li data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"874\">\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"874\"><strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"804\">Slim &amp; Modern Design</strong> \u2013 Clean lines with a smooth, diffused cover for a contemporary look</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"959\">\n<p data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"959\"><strong data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"907\">Uniform Light Distribution</strong> \u2013 Eliminates harsh shadows and reduces eye strain</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1052\">\n<p data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1052\"><strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"997\">Energy Efficient LED Technology</strong> \u2013 Lower power usage compared to traditional lighting</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1136\">\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1136\"><strong data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1079\">Durable Construction</strong> \u2013 Built for long service life with minimal maintenance</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1215\">\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1215\"><strong data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1160\">Easy Installation</strong> \u2013 Suitable for surface mounting on ceilings or walls</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1263\">\n<p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1263\"><strong data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1232\">Instant ON</strong> \u2013 No flicker or warm-up time</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1285\">Available Sizes:</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1494\">\n<li data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1376\">\n<p data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1376\"><strong data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1312\">2FT LED Batten Light</strong> \u2013 Ideal for compact areas, shelves, kitchens, and small rooms</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1494\">\n<p data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1494\"><strong data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1403\">4FT LED Batten Light</strong> \u2013 Perfect for larger spaces such as offices, garages, hallways, and commercial interiors</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1680\">This LED batten light is a reliable and stylish lighting solution that combines performance with modern aesthetics, making it suitable for both residential and commercial applications.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">ORIENT Lighting Office, <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0333/6745/7925/files/des_icon_img.png\"></p>\n<h2>Applications</h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Home</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Office</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Malls</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Hospitality</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Commercial Area</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Shops</li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: square;\">Other General Use</li>\n</ul>", "published_at": "2026-01-29T14:02:44+05:00", "created_at": "2021-01-07T10:46: